# Response headers on Cloudflare Workers (docs/hosting.md).
#
# Caching stays at Cloudflare's default, "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate":
# every load checks for a new version, and the service worker keeps the files
# for the installed app. Don't give assets/ a longer life here. An address that
# isn't a file gets the app's page, and that must never be kept as a script.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
